        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Vendor provides BuildRight with: updated authentic product reference library (images, specifications, security feature guide), counterfeit trend alerts for Philippine market, brand authorization verification API (real-time check if seller is authorized dealer), co-funding for anti-counterfeit technology deployment
Responsible (R): LP Manager / Vendor
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly updates</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2570_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2570_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2570_Task6" name="LP Manager coordinates joint enforcement: shares intelligence on counterfeit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: LP Manager coordinates joint enforcement: shares intelligence on counterfeit networks, coordinates marketplace takedown actions, participates in vendor-led investigation of supply chain breaches, reports enforcement outcomes to vendor quarterly
Responsible (R): LP Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2570_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2570_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
