      <bpmn:userTask id="W2571_Task6" name="LP Analyst updates anti-counterfeit KPI dashboard: counterfeit detection rate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: LP Analyst updates anti-counterfeit KPI dashboard: counterfeit detection rate, authentication scan volume, customer verification requests, vendor compliance rate, investigation resolution time, marketplace takedown success rate, financial impact trend, staff training completion rate
Responsible (R): LP Analyst
Accountable (A): LP Manager
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2571_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2571_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
