Responsible (R): LP Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2571_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2571_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2571_Task8" name="COO includes anti-counterfeit metrics in quarterly executive report: program…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: COO includes anti-counterfeit metrics in quarterly executive report: program ROI, risk assessment by category, strategic initiatives progress; presented to CEO and Board as part of risk management update
Responsible (R): COO
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2571_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2571_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
