      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Industry forum schedule or significant intelligence sharing opportunity
Frequency: Quarterly industry meetings; ad-hoc intelligence exchange
Volume: 4 quarterly meetings; 6–12 intelligence exchanges/year
Owner: LP Manager
Participants: LP Manager, Industry Peers, DTI, IPOPHL
Source: workflow W2572 — Industry Anti-Counterfeit Collaboration &amp; Intelligence Sharing</bpmn:documentation>
