      <bpmn:userTask id="W2572_Task4" name="LP Manager participates in industry anti-counterfeit forums: Philippine…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: LP Manager participates in industry anti-counterfeit forums: Philippine Retailers Association LP committee, IPOPHL (Intellectual Property Office of the Philippines) consultations, DTI consumer protection coordination; shares anonymized intelligence on counterfeiting trends and methods
Responsible (R): LP Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1–2 days/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2572_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2572_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2572_Task5" name="LP Manager exchanges intelligence with peer retailers (anonymized…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: LP Manager exchanges intelligence with peer retailers (anonymized, non-competitive): counterfeit source identification, common modus operandi, vendor integrity concerns, marketplace enforcement challenges; receives intelligence in return that improves BuildRight&#x27;s detection capability
Responsible (R): LP Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Ad-hoc</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2572_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2572_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2572_Task6" name="LP Manager contributes to policy advocacy: supports stronger IP enforcement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: LP Manager contributes to policy advocacy: supports stronger IP enforcement through industry associations, provides retail-sector perspective to IPOPHL and DTI on counterfeiting impact, participates in draft regulation consultations affecting product authentication requirements
Responsible (R): LP Manager / VP Legal
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Ad-hoc</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2572_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2572_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
